# ATP-Upload/1 설계 예제. 실제 서버/토큰/바이너리 파일로 바꾼 뒤 사용한다.
# OpenAPI와 09 문서의 계약을 함께 적용한다. API 구현이 제공된 것은 아니다.
@base = https://api.example.invalid/v1
@task = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@token = REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_TOKEN

### 확정 offset 확인. 204, 본문 없음.
HEAD {{base}}/upload-tasks/{{task}}/content
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Upload-Generation: 1

### 1MiB 청크. 실제 파일의 크기와 SHA256으로 헤더를 대체한다.
PATCH {{base}}/upload-tasks/{{task}}/content
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/offset+octet-stream
Content-Length: 1048576
Upload-Offset: 0
Upload-Generation: 1
Upload-Checksum: sha256 REPLACE_WITH_64_HEX_CHUNK_SHA256

< ./chunk.bin

### transport 재발급. 같은 요청 키 재전송은 같은 generation.
POST {{base}}/upload-tasks/{{task}}/retries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 00000000-retry-0001

{"sameFileFingerprint":"aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"}

### 전송 100% 후 필수 서버 처리 접수. 신규202 Operation, 공개 완료 아님.
POST {{base}}/upload-tasks/{{task}}/commit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 00000000-commit-001

{"checksum":"aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa","actualBytes":1048576}
